Package: dfmtools
Title: Bayesian Inference of Dynamic Factor Models
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-01
Authors@R: person(c("Franz", "X."), "Mohr", email = "franz.x.mohr@outlook.com", role = c("aut","cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-8890-7781"))
Description: Assists in the set-up of algorithms for Bayesian inference of dynamic factor models. Functions for posterior simulation and forecasting are largely based on the introductory texts of Chan, Koop, Poirier and Tobias (2019, ISBN: 9781108437493) and Luetkepohl (2006, ISBN: 9783540262398).
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5),
    bvartools (>= 1.0.0)
Imports: coda, methods, Rcpp (>= 0.12.14), stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: GNU make
LazyData: true
Encoding: UTF-8
